    <briefdescription>
<para>A random number generator. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Instances of this class should not be shared across threads. The seed should be set by passing the -rng-seed=&lt;uint64&gt; option. <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_use" kindref="compound">Use</ref> <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_module_1a8b82325a22b25d4278a37af30b202a30" kindref="member">Module::createRNG</ref> to create a new RNG instance for use with that module. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
